        "html": "<article class='wo002-detail-page live-visual-page' data-companion-context='support' data-companion-copy='This page explains the current preview state. Guest website progress can persist locally, but account sync and a public support endpoint are not configured.' data-companion-reaction='friendly'><nav class='detail-breadcrumb' aria-label='Breadcrumb'><a href='/'>Home</a><span aria-hidden='true'>/</span><span>Support</span></nav><section class='wo002-detail-hero'><div class='wo002-detail-copy'><p class='section-kicker'>HELP FOR THIS WEBSITE PREVIEW</p><span class='chip preview'>STAGING INFORMATION</span><h1>How can we help?</h1><p class='wo002-detail-lede'>This page explains the current state of the website preview. A public support contact, support inbox, and contact form have not been configured here.</p><div class='wo002-detail-actions'><a class='button-link button-link--primary' href='/play/'>Understand game previews <span aria-hidden='true'>→</span></a><a class='button-link button-link--secondary' href='/app/'>App availability</a></div></div><figure class='wo002-detail-art'><img src='/assets/images/characters/toadal-portrait.webp' alt='Toadal, the crowned golden-yellow hero of TOADAL FEAST.' width='256' height='256' decoding='async'><figcaption>Toadal character artwork.</figcaption></figure></section><section class='support-search-panel' aria-labelledby='support-search-title'><p class='section-kicker'>FILTER HELP</p><h2 id='support-search-title'>Find a help topic</h2><label for='support-search-input'>Search these help topics</label><input id='support-search-input' data-support-search type='search' autocomplete='off' placeholder='Try progress, preview, or contact'><p data-support-count role='status' aria-live='polite'>3 help topics shown.</p></section><section class='wo002-detail-facts' aria-label='Frequently asked questions'><article class='detail-fact' id='preview-states' data-support-article data-support-text='games preview public release' data-companion-context='support-games' data-companion-copy='PREVIEW is for evaluation and does not mean a game is publicly released.'><p class='section-kicker'>GAMES</p><h2>What does PREVIEW mean?</h2><p>PREVIEW identifies an evaluation build or concept. It is not a public-release label. The Play directory describes which entries can open and which remain held or concept-only.</p><a href='/play/'>Visit Play <span aria-hidden='true'>→</span></a></article><article class='detail-fact' id='guest-progress' data-support-article data-support-text='progress guest local browser save account sync' data-companion-context='support-progress' data-companion-copy='Guest website progress can persist locally on this browser, but account sync is not available.'><p class='section-kicker'>PROGRESS</p><h2>Is progress saved?</h2><p>Feast Pass progress can persist locally on this browser. There is still no sign-in or cross-device account sync. Wicked Bites remains an isolated, session-only staging preview.</p><a href='/feast-pass/'>Feast Pass status <span aria-hidden='true'>→</span></a></article><article class='detail-fact' id='contact-status' data-support-article data-support-text='contact support email form endpoint' data-companion-context='support-contact' data-companion-copy='No verified support email or form is configured; do not send personal information through this preview.'><p class='section-kicker'>CONTACT</p><h2>No public contact configured</h2><p>A support email address or submission endpoint has not been configured for this staging site.</p><a href='/contact/'>Contact & feedback preview</a><br><a href='/legal/'>Legal status</a></article></section><aside class='toadal-companion' data-companion data-zone='hero' aria-label='Toadal contextual helper'><div class='companion-panel' id='toadal-companion-panel' data-companion-panel><p class='companion-label'>TOADAL SAYS</p><p class='companion-message' data-companion-speech aria-live='polite' aria-atomic='true'>This page explains the current preview state. Guest website progress can persist locally, but account sync and a public support endpoint are not configured.</p></div><button class='companion-toggle' type='button' data-companion-toggle aria-controls='toadal-companion-panel' aria-expanded='true' aria-label='Minimize Toadal helper'><img class='companion-image' data-companion-image src='/assets/images/characters/toadal-victory.png' alt='' width='611' height='640' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><span class='sr-only'>Minimize Toadal helper</span></button></aside></article>"
